{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The IvorMIDI framework provides MIDI channel message, system message, and data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value types written in Swift. Channel messages cover note on and off,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"polyphonic and channel pressure, control change, program change, and pitch"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bend change; system messages cover system exclusive, system common, and system"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"real-time messages. Channel and system messages, and the data values they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carry, can be converted to and from their "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/midi.org\/midi-1-0"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wire encoding."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Registered (RPN) and non-registered (NRPN) parameters, such as pitch bend"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sensitivity and fine tuning, can be set with a single call that builds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whole control change sequence. Universal system exclusive messages for master"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"volume, master tuning, and all of the MIDI Tuning Standard are built the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"way, as are the bank select and program change messages that set a channel to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIPatch"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDITuningMessage"},{"type":"text","text":" decodes MIDI Tuning Standard messages."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIPitchBend"},{"type":"text","text":" can be made from a bend in cents and the synthesizer’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pitch bend sensitivity."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import IvorMIDI","","\/\/ Middle C, velocity 100, on channel 1.","let noteOn = MIDIChannelMessage.noteOn(1, 60, 100)","","noteOn.statusByte   \/\/ 0x90","noteOn.dataBytes    \/\/ [0x3C, 0x64]","","\/\/ Decode a message from its wire encoding.","let decoded = MIDIChannelMessage(statusByte: 0x90,","                                 dataBytes: [0x3c, 0x64])","","decoded == noteOn   \/\/ true"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/UsingIvorMIDI"},{"type":"text","text":" for a full guide to the messages, the data values, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the wire encoding."}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormidi"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"collection","modules":[{"name":"IvorMIDI"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","color":{"standardColorIdentifier":"blue"},"symbolKind":"module","externalID":"IvorMIDI","title":"IvorMIDI"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/UsingIvorMIDI"],"anchor":"Guides","title":"Guides"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIChannelMessage","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDISystemMessage","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDITuningMessage"],"anchor":"Messages","title":"Messages"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/documentation\/IvorMIDI\/MIDIChannel","doc:\/\/IvorMIDI\/do